n\n- Reproducible on v4.7.dev3.official.60fff00a6\n- Not reproducible on v4.6.2.stable.official.71f334935, v4.7.dev2.official.778cf54da\n\n### System information\n\n Windows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am unable to install any asset from the Asset Library on 4.7.dev3, neither a project template nor an addon. Starting console version with `--verbose` flag does not yield any useful debug information. The asset gets downloaded, but according to the error message Godot is unable to unpack it. \n\n> \"Error opening package file, not in ZIP format.\"\n\n<img width=\"638\" height=\"404\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06d95bd2-b578-40ed-b26f-47ea7d8307b7\" /> \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start v4.7.dev3\n2. From the project selection menu go to Asset Library\n3. Choose and download any online template (e.g. Maaack's Game Template)\n4. Try to install the project\n5. See an alert saying \"Error opening package file, not in ZIP format.\"\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nProject is not needed to reproduce the issue. See reproduction steps.","closed_by":{"login":"linuxhuskarl","id":43964891,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTY0ODkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43964891?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl","html_url":"https://github.com/linuxhuskarl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linuxhuskarl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u